<h2>Information and practice</h2><p>Stocklumo is a free informational market-tracking application operated by Omar Hussain Fahmi. It does not provide investment advice, personalized recommendations, brokerage services or trade execution. Virtual portfolio entries are hypothetical and do not buy or sell securities.</p>
<h2>Market-data limitations</h2><p>Quotes, fundamentals, news and earnings depend on Finnhub and original publishers. Information may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable or incorrect. Check timestamps and original sources. A connected stream does not guarantee fresh prices. Do not rely on Stocklumo as your sole basis for financial decisions.</p>
<h2>Use and availability</h2><p>Use the service lawfully. Do not attempt to bypass rate limits, disrupt other visitors, obtain credentials or redistribute provider data beyond its permitted use. Data and publisher content remain subject to their owners' rights. Hosting interruptions, market closures and provider limits may affect availability.</p>
<h2>Your saved data</h2><p>Your watchlist, settings and practice holdings stay in your browser. They can be lost if storage is cleared or the site origin changes. Export backups from <a href="/settings">Privacy &amp; backups</a>. Stocklumo does not hold a server copy of those records. Read our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
<h2>Responsibility and contact</h2><p>The service is provided as available, without a guarantee of uninterrupted access or accuracy. Nothing here excludes rights or liabilities that applicable law does not allow to be excluded. Questions, errors or concerns: <a href="mailto:omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com">omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com</a>.</p></article>
